// Boundary cases: LIMIT bounds rows and the pushed size cannot drop rows the kept LIMIT still needs.
// result_position: head + the tiebreaker pin row identity deterministically. The full query has 3 matches
// (event pairs 1-2, 2-3, 3-4) = 6 rows; a smaller LIMIT trims the prefix.
